letitedit: the resample filter's close also closes the filter's own service and properties, as the other filters'
close functions do; without it a closed resample filter (every clip the loader makes has one) kept its properties
(17 Windows handles) for the rest of the process. From engine-patches/mlt-resample-close; applies on MLT
63218a28d21f1e64b5b9e6671b4ff9146023282c (the resample module, lib/mlt/libmltresample.dll).

diff --git a/src/modules/resample/filter_resample.c b/src/modules/resample/filter_resample.c
index ee8e09f7..96e89ac5 100644
--- a/src/modules/resample/filter_resample.c
+++ b/src/modules/resample/filter_resample.c
@@ -238,6 +238,11 @@ static void close_filter(mlt_filter filter)
         free(pdata);
         filter->child = NULL;
     }
+    // Close the filter's own service and properties too, as the other filters' close functions do: without it a
+    // closed resample filter kept its properties (17 Windows handles) for the rest of the process.
+    filter->close = NULL;
+    filter->parent.close = NULL;
+    mlt_service_close(&filter->parent);
 }
 
 /** Constructor for the filter.
